{"call_id": "abe3a9bfbc2943ddac357184b462281c", "success": true, "result_file": "/data/nly/Agent-Aware-Trajectory-Level-Query/benchmark/fullbench/runs/fad/PANCANCER_ATLAS/query2/full-01/results/abe3a9bfbc2943ddac357184b462281c.json", "row_count": null, "preview": "{\"stdout\": \"histological_type                        alive_total cdh1_mut      pct\\nInfiltrating Lobular Carcinoma                   178       90   50.56%\\nMixed Histology (please specify)                  24        4   16.67%\\nOther  specify                                    36        3    8.33%\\nInfiltrating Ductal Carcinoma                    671       14    2.09%\\nMetaplastic Carcinoma                              7        0    0.00%\\nInfiltrating Carcinoma NOS                         1        0    0.00%\\nMucinous Carcinoma                                14        0    0.00%\\nMedullary Carcinoma                                4        0    0.00%\\nNone                                               1        0    0.00%\\n\\nTotal alive BRCA patients: 936\\nUnique barcodes: 936\\nNull barcode rows: 0\\n\", \"stderr\": \"\", \"returncode\": 0}", "truncated": false}
{"call_id": "4146ecfb2d90461283657cfe8e4ff322", "success": true, "result_file": "/data/nly/Agent-Aware-Trajectory-Level-Query/benchmark/fullbench/runs/fad/PANCANCER_ATLAS/query2/full-01/results/4146ecfb2d90461283657cfe8e4ff322.json", "row_count": null, "preview": "{\"submitted\": true, \"answer\": \"Among BRCA (breast invasive carcinoma) patients in the PanCancer Atlas who are alive (936 patients total), the top three histological types with the highest percentage of CDH1 gene mutations are:\\n\\n1. Infiltrating Lobular Carcinoma — 50.56% (90 of 178 alive patients carry a CDH1 mutation)\\n2. Mixed Histology (please specify) — 16.67% (4 of 24 alive patients)\\n3. Other, specify — 8.33% (3 of 36 alive patients)\\n\\n(For comparison, Infiltrating Ductal Carcinoma, the most common type, has only 2.09% — 14 of 671 alive patients.)\\n\\nMethod: Alive BRCA patients were identified from clinical_info (Patient_description indicating breast invasive carcinoma and vital status Alive; cross-validated with days_to_death = '[Not Applicable]'), and CDH1 mutation carriers were taken as distinct ParticipantBarcodes in Mutation_Data with Hugo_Symbol = 'CDH1'. Percentages were computed per histological_type as mutated patients / total alive patients of that type.\\n\"}", "truncated": false}
